p Dear #{@user.decorate.full_name},
p The following reports are ready for approval and requires your action.

p Project: #{@project.name}
p Campaign: #{@campaign.name}
p Report: #{@report.name}
p Count of reports: #{@reports.size}

p You are receiving this email as you have been added as an approver for the reports, which requires approval.

p You can access the report via the following link:

= link_to 'Reports', @url
